# Stack conventions

- App Router only. Server secrets in `src/lib/*` and route handlers; `"server-only"` for AssemblyAI and Recall keys.
- Domain logic in `src/modules/<domain>/`. Register routers in `src/trpc/routers/_app.ts`.
- Capture pipes implement `src/lib/pipes`. Do not couple Voice Agent or DB to Recall.
- Mutations/queries: tRPC + TanStack Query. Zod inputs.
- DB: Drizzle on Neon. `src/db/schema.ts`. `npm run db:push`.
- Post-session: Inngest, not a blocking request.
- UI: existing shadcn. No Polar, no Stream Video.
- LLM work goes through AssemblyAI LLM Gateway. No OpenAI SDK.
